flowchart LR
    Client[Cliente HTTPS] --> APIGW["API Gateway por ambiente (fiap-lambda)"]
    APIGW --> VPCL[VPC Link]
    subgraph VPC["VPC privada sa-east-1"]
        VPCL --> ALB["ALB interno fiap-shared-api"]
        subgraph EKS["EKS fiap-shared: 2 nós t3.medium fixos"]
            ALB --> INGD[Ingress /develop] --> PD["Pods API develop<br/>HPA 1–2"]
            ALB --> INGH[Ingress /homol] --> PH["Pods API homol<br/>HPA 1–2"]
            ALB --> INGP[Ingress /prod] --> PP["Pods API prod<br/>HPA 2–4"]
            NRI["New Relic nri-bundle"]
        end
        PD & PH & PP --> RDS[("RDS PostgreSQL (fiap-database)")]
        CB[CodeBuild privado] --> EKS
    end
    PD & PH & PP -. Pod Identity .-> MAIL[Lambda de e-mail do ambiente]
    ECR[ECR: imagens por commit] --> EKS
    GitHub[GitHub Actions / OIDC] --> IAM[IAM por repositório e ambiente]
    IAM --> TF[Terraform] --> VPC
    IAM --> CB
    NRI --> NR[New Relic: métricas, logs, traces e alertas]
    EB["EventBridge rate(5 min)"] --> UP[Lambda fiap-uptime-probe]
    UP -->|health e JWKS| APIGW
    UP --> NR
    PROBE[Lambda fiap-observability-probe] -->|consulta telemetria| NR
    CB -.->|verifica após deploy| PROBE
